# eval3r environment variable template.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in locally. Never commit `.env` or real values.
# Only variable names and comments belong here (see CLAUDE.md data rules).

# Absolute path to a local MATLAB executable, used ONLY for the DTU MATLAB
# official-script evaluation path. MATLAB is the single optional external tool;
# it is not a pip dependency. When unset, eval3r uses the validated Python port.
# E3R_MATLAB_BIN=

# Absolute path to a built ETH3DMultiViewEvaluation binary from
# github.com/ETH3D/multi-view-evaluation, used ONLY for the ETH3D official
# evaluation wrapper (eth3d_official backend). It is a user-supplied external
# build, not a pip dependency. When unset, ETH3D official runs fail explicitly
# and the wrapper tests skip.
# EVAL3R_ETH3D_TOOL=
